    "name": "Initial - website booking intake",
    "description": "Initial version: public CORS-enabled webhook for the marketing site's booking modal. Looks up the package, computes and updates remaining seats, upserts the customer by phone, creates a Pending/Unpaid booking, sends a Telegram notification including remaining seats, and responds with JSON for the site to show a confirmation.",
